{{define "en.reset.subject"}}Your SMemories password reset code{{end}}
{{define "en.reset.text"}}Hi {{.Name}},

Someone asked to reset the password of your SMemories account. Your reset code is:

{{.Code}}

Type it in the app to choose a new password. It is valid for {{.Minutes}} minutes. Do not share this code with anyone.

